# A timer left running rings over the face: it lights the dark screen and opens the timer.
open app timer
tap 120 202                 # the start button under the duration picker
switch to face digital
screen off
wait 9min
expect no text "Time's up"
wait 1min
expect text "Time's up"
expect effect vibrate-pattern alarm

tap "Dismiss"
expect effect stop-vibrating
expect no failures
